 he ethics\, politics and history of AI.\n\nOrganisation: Cornell Universit
 y\, College of Arts and Sciences\nLocation: Ithaca\, New York\, USA\nAward
 : USD 70\,000 per year plus full benefits and a USD 4\,000 annual research
  account (further funds by application). No application fee.\nDuration: Tw
 o years\, 1 August 2027 to 31 July 2029\n\nMore: https://academicjobsonlin
